WEBVTT

01:30.340 --> 01:33.578
=Against The Current=

01:33.579 --> 01:35.000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

01:35.180 --> 01:36.920
=Episode 7=
(This drama does not correspond)

01:36.930 --> 01:38.200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

01:38.210 --> 01:41.110
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

01:45.879 --> 01:47.599
Madam Feng, Lanxiang.

01:48.079 --> 01:49.439
Wait downstairs.

01:50.200 --> 01:50.840
- Yes.
- Yes.

01:51.680 --> 01:52.439
Shopkeeper Liu.

01:52.936 --> 01:53.950
Go tell Young Lady Qian

01:54.000 --> 01:55.480
to bring all the account books.

01:56.568 --> 01:58.640
I'll question her
after I've gone through them.

01:59.040 --> 01:59.480
Yes.

02:37.060 --> 02:40.300
(Su Plum Blossom Pastries)

03:11.960 --> 03:12.719
Young Lady Qian.

03:13.000 --> 03:14.560
Young Madam is already inside.

03:30.479 --> 03:32.759
(How could a woman
have such large feet?)

03:34.712 --> 03:35.928
(Something's not right.)

03:35.960 --> 03:36.680
(That's a man.)

03:48.600 --> 03:50.860
Young Madam is going through
the accounts very carefully.

03:50.879 --> 03:52.240
She won't be down anytime soon.

03:53.080 --> 03:54.240
Come sit with me.

03:59.360 --> 04:00.159
What's wrong?

04:17.940 --> 04:19.959
(Jinxiu House)

04:19.960 --> 04:21.300
- Young Master.
- Young Master.

04:25.192 --> 04:26.750
We've been taking turns
keeping watch for several days.

04:26.800 --> 04:28.879
This morning, we waited for
Young Madam to leave the residence

04:28.920 --> 04:30.690
and followed her
all the way to Jinxiu House.

04:30.824 --> 04:32.070
We've checked out Jinxiu House.

04:32.080 --> 04:33.230
Aside from the shop employees,

04:33.240 --> 04:35.080
everyone coming and going
has been a woman.

04:35.144 --> 04:36.280
Nothing seems unusual.

04:42.776 --> 04:44.240
We've been staking it out for days.

04:44.328 --> 04:45.656
Let's go have a look around.

04:50.240 --> 04:50.800
Let's go.

04:52.100 --> 04:59.460
(Jinxiu House)

05:01.439 --> 05:03.040
My period started.

05:03.199 --> 05:04.360
I caught a bit of a chill,

05:04.360 --> 05:05.639
and I'm not feeling well.

05:06.040 --> 05:08.000
I'd like some brown sugar water.

05:11.240 --> 05:12.680
Being a woman can be such a nuisance.

05:15.240 --> 05:16.160
Go out

05:16.170 --> 05:18.520
and have a bowl of fermented rice
with brown sugar and egg.

05:18.920 --> 05:20.439
Bring me a bowl too while you're at it.

05:22.680 --> 05:23.560
Thank you, Madam Feng.

05:30.079 --> 05:31.639
She really is young.

05:36.488 --> 05:37.560
Pick whichever you like.

05:38.600 --> 05:39.680
Do you know what this is?

05:44.072 --> 05:45.080
The Four Don'ts Dolls.

05:49.040 --> 05:49.639
And this one?

05:49.864 --> 05:51.368
This one's called Don't Look.

05:54.120 --> 05:54.720
This one

05:55.240 --> 05:56.390
is called Don't Listen.

05:58.160 --> 06:00.160
If you see something you shouldn't

06:00.648 --> 06:02.190
or hear something you shouldn't...

06:29.880 --> 06:31.496
You know what that means, don't you?

06:48.199 --> 06:49.519
(Lin Jinqi is here, too.)

06:52.079 --> 06:54.040
(If Lin Jinqi realizes I know,)

06:54.439 --> 06:55.560
(I'll surely die.)

06:57.000 --> 06:58.879
(If Zhao Xingtang realizes I know,)

06:59.560 --> 07:00.920
(I'll surely die, too.)

07:04.500 --> 07:08.700
(Jinxiu House)

07:08.700 --> 07:09.544
This is the place.

07:26.199 --> 07:27.600
You blind fool!

07:27.639 --> 07:28.879
Watch where you're going!

07:29.160 --> 07:31.120
My clothes!

07:31.240 --> 07:31.879
I'm sorry.

07:31.920 --> 07:33.160
And my fabric!

07:33.160 --> 07:33.879
I'll pay for it.

07:33.959 --> 07:34.800
I promise I'll pay.

07:34.879 --> 07:36.079
Can you even afford it?

07:36.080 --> 07:36.808
What's going on?

07:38.776 --> 07:39.870
What are you doing here?

07:41.079 --> 07:41.600
I...

07:46.319 --> 07:48.040
Someone, come quickly!

07:48.319 --> 07:50.920
This shop is mistreating me!

07:51.079 --> 07:54.879
They're bullying
a helpless widow like me!

07:56.199 --> 07:59.639
They knocked me down,
and no one's doing anything about it!

07:59.680 --> 08:01.759
Look what they've done to me!

08:01.920 --> 08:04.000
This is outrageous!

08:04.800 --> 08:06.759
Just look what they've done to me!

08:07.160 --> 08:08.480
If you don't settle this today,

08:08.519 --> 08:11.360
I'm not getting up!

08:11.639 --> 08:14.519
Everyone, come judge for yourselves!

08:14.712 --> 08:15.600
This is outrageous!

08:15.600 --> 08:17.800
(Now I can prove I wasn't there)

08:18.136 --> 08:19.928
(and knew nothing about it, right?)

08:20.920 --> 08:21.879
Don't touch my fabric!

08:21.879 --> 08:22.759
Deal with this!

08:24.920 --> 08:26.759
They're bullying me!

08:26.759 --> 08:29.000
This shop is mistreating me!

08:33.559 --> 08:34.320
Zijin.

08:35.120 --> 08:36.039
What's going on?

08:37.144 --> 08:39.240
It seems a customer
is causing trouble in the shop.

08:39.480 --> 08:41.120
A large crowd has gathered to watch.

08:41.416 --> 08:43.240
Shopkeeper Liu
has already gone to handle it.

08:50.679 --> 08:52.600
Why don't you head back for today?

08:54.240 --> 08:56.559
We can settle the accounts another day.

08:57.879 --> 08:58.759
What a disappointment.

08:59.919 --> 09:01.080
If you're this timid

09:01.352 --> 09:03.480
and want to run
at the slightest disturbance,

09:03.880 --> 09:05.432
why did you come to see me at all?

09:19.440 --> 09:20.480
Everything I've done

09:20.840 --> 09:22.000
has been for you.

09:23.600 --> 09:26.039
I'm a man. I don't fear
what people might say.

09:27.000 --> 09:29.639
But this world
is especially harsh on women.

09:30.600 --> 09:33.120
Even gossip can ruin a woman.

10:01.600 --> 10:02.519
Wait until I've left,

10:02.552 --> 10:04.072
then put on a show with Shopkeeper Liu

10:04.104 --> 10:04.760
before you leave.

10:05.240 --> 10:05.960
I know.

10:06.000 --> 10:07.639
You're already dressed like this.

10:08.039 --> 10:09.879
Even Shopkeeper Liu
thinks you're a woman.

10:10.799 --> 10:12.279
Who would suspect anything?

10:13.639 --> 10:14.399
I'm leaving, then.

10:33.279 --> 10:34.519
Go get your young lady ready.

10:34.720 --> 10:36.399
Remember to clean up the bed

10:36.919 --> 10:38.279
and leave no trace behind.

12:37.820 --> 12:41.420
(Zhao Xingtang, Young)

12:42.399 --> 12:43.879
My period started.

12:44.360 --> 12:45.720
I'm unclean right now,

12:46.320 --> 12:48.559
so we can't share a bed tonight.

13:01.192 --> 13:02.856
Then I'll sleep in the side chamber.

13:10.039 --> 13:11.240
With my condition,

13:11.440 --> 13:13.279
sometimes I go months without a period,

13:13.799 --> 13:15.480
and other times the bleeding drags on

13:15.480 --> 13:17.272
for two or three months
without stopping.

13:17.679 --> 13:20.759
I'm afraid tomorrow, the day after,

13:20.919 --> 13:23.360
the day after that,
and even the next day,

13:24.088 --> 13:25.840
we still won't be able to share a bed.

13:29.120 --> 13:29.879
I understand.

13:35.860 --> 13:38.100
♪My thoughts are like a red umbrella♪

13:38.460 --> 13:40.820
♪Drifting through the rain♪

13:41.300 --> 13:46.140
♪Held tightly in my hand,
shielding me from hidden currents♪

13:46.500 --> 13:51.340
♪Yet fate stains my sleeves with blood♪

13:51.340 --> 13:55.740
♪Raindrops fall,
one by one, into my dreams♪

13:57.260 --> 13:59.420
♪If they should wake me♪

13:59.780 --> 14:01.940
♪Hardship will always remain♪

14:02.300 --> 14:07.140
♪Amid treacherous waters,
few make it to the end♪

14:07.500 --> 14:12.500
♪How could a thousand words
soothe this aching heart?♪

14:12.500 --> 14:17.620
♪With guilt in my heart,
how could I ask to meet again?♪

14:19.740 --> 14:24.660
♪May I be like a firefly
awakening in the dark♪

14:24.660 --> 14:29.860
♪Even if I only cast light
on one cycle of bloom and decay♪

14:30.580 --> 14:35.540
♪If only I could move someone's heart♪

14:35.900 --> 14:40.460
♪I'd spend every dawn
and dusk to see it through♪

14:40.780 --> 14:45.940
♪May I be like a firefly
awakening in the dark♪

14:45.940 --> 14:51.540
♪Even if I only
illuminate a single corner♪

14:51.900 --> 14:56.740
♪If I could bring
light to someone's eyes♪

14:56.740 --> 15:04.900
♪I'd spend this life
and call it courage♪

15:24.360 --> 15:25.672
I don't want to paint anymore.

15:26.840 --> 15:28.968
(Lin Zhaoxiang's Study)
Before you've even arrived,

15:29.519 --> 15:32.840
the fragrance of plum blossoms
has already drifted in,

15:33.759 --> 15:36.639
leaving me unable to concentrate.

15:41.919 --> 15:42.879
On my way here,

15:43.192 --> 15:45.224
I saw the red plum
blossoms in full bloom,

15:45.639 --> 15:47.960
so I picked
two branches for you, Grandfather.

15:49.960 --> 15:50.600
Sit.

15:53.416 --> 15:55.750
His Majesty has summoned
scholars from far and wide

15:56.039 --> 15:57.960
to compile the Compendium of Literature,

15:59.120 --> 16:02.279
but the chief compiler
has yet to be appointed.

16:03.559 --> 16:05.519
The two leading candidates at court

16:05.720 --> 16:09.279
are Old Master Zhao
and Grand Secretary Xie.

16:10.240 --> 16:12.240
Your father is eager to make his move.

16:13.240 --> 16:15.720
He wants to rally
the scholars of Jiangnan

16:15.799 --> 16:18.519
to build support for Old Master Zhao.

16:19.320 --> 16:20.519
I've heard about it.

16:21.399 --> 16:22.879
Your father alone

16:23.200 --> 16:26.240
probably can't persuade
the leading scholars to join him.

16:29.960 --> 16:31.360
Do you think our Lin family

16:31.480 --> 16:34.720
should help him or not?

16:37.600 --> 16:38.000
We should.

17:04.240 --> 17:06.880
Can you and the eldest daughter
of the Zhao family

17:06.920 --> 17:08.759
really not make it work?

17:11.960 --> 17:13.000
The sooner a mistake

17:14.160 --> 17:15.359
is corrected, the better.

17:21.039 --> 17:22.519
I originally thought

17:22.720 --> 17:25.240
that since our families
are already related by marriage,

17:25.400 --> 17:27.480
we've grown too close.

17:27.960 --> 17:30.359
So we shouldn't help with this.

17:30.680 --> 17:33.119
I was going to let
your father make his futile efforts

17:33.519 --> 17:36.039
and simply keep up appearances.

17:38.519 --> 17:41.359
Since you've made up your mind,

17:45.240 --> 17:46.640
then this time,

17:48.240 --> 17:50.640
we must help.

17:55.759 --> 17:57.240
Though you chose a military career,

17:57.759 --> 17:59.599
you've earned your place

17:59.839 --> 18:02.319
through your own hard-fought battles.

18:03.960 --> 18:07.720
But Zhao Jin is one
of His Majesty's trusted confidants.

18:07.960 --> 18:09.519
We must never offend him.

18:12.559 --> 18:13.559
I understand.

20:05.240 --> 20:05.839
My Lady.

20:06.000 --> 20:07.519
The bed has been warmed with incense.

20:07.519 --> 20:08.759
You can rest now.

20:22.000 --> 20:24.000
Young Madam, Lanxiang
is still kneeling outside.

20:24.039 --> 20:25.200
Then let her kneel.

20:25.200 --> 20:26.680
Please show mercy, Young Madam.

20:29.720 --> 20:30.680
In a few days,

20:31.039 --> 20:32.960
it will be First Madam An's birthday.

20:34.056 --> 20:36.056
You'll be going
to celebrate her birthday.

20:36.632 --> 20:38.070
If you fall out with the Lin family

20:38.279 --> 20:40.000
over a mere maid,

20:40.279 --> 20:42.759
it won't look good when the time comes.

20:50.400 --> 20:51.720
Raise the curtain.

21:30.984 --> 21:32.680
Do you know what you did wrong?

21:41.640 --> 21:42.279
Yes.

21:43.359 --> 21:44.319
Speak up.

21:48.319 --> 21:49.279
Yes...

21:53.119 --> 21:54.240
What did you do wrong?

21:56.000 --> 21:56.920
I shouldn't have

21:58.839 --> 21:59.599
gone out

22:00.839 --> 22:01.839
without

22:03.359 --> 22:05.160
Madam Feng's and Zijin's permission

22:07.200 --> 22:08.240
to buy things

22:09.480 --> 22:10.319
on my own...

22:12.232 --> 22:13.640
And I certainly shouldn't have

22:14.640 --> 22:15.920
been so careless

22:16.799 --> 22:18.799
and bumped into a customer at the shop,

22:21.319 --> 22:23.440
causing the shop to pay compensation...

22:29.960 --> 22:31.519
I'll be generous

22:32.759 --> 22:34.960
and let this go.

22:36.200 --> 22:38.279
Pay back
what the shop had to compensate,

22:39.279 --> 22:42.200
and we'll consider the matter settled.

22:43.240 --> 22:44.200
Yes...

22:46.839 --> 22:47.559
Get up.

22:55.839 --> 22:56.960
Serves you right.

23:13.680 --> 23:14.319
Lanxiang.

23:15.640 --> 23:16.400
Lanxiang.

23:20.079 --> 23:21.079
It's all my fault.

23:21.599 --> 23:22.519
It's all my fault.

23:26.559 --> 23:27.720
I'll help you back.

23:37.759 --> 23:39.000
Let's go back.

23:57.920 --> 23:58.759
We're almost there.

24:03.000 --> 24:03.880
Lanxiang.

24:04.440 --> 24:05.480
Lanxiang!

24:15.480 --> 24:16.079
Lanxiang.

24:17.119 --> 24:17.440
Here.

24:17.680 --> 24:18.079
Easy.

24:31.279 --> 24:32.200
Take care of Lanxiang.

24:32.240 --> 24:33.400
I'll go get some hot water.

24:33.519 --> 24:34.559
I've got everything ready.

24:35.279 --> 24:35.680
Here.

24:49.624 --> 24:50.550
You're such a dear.

24:50.616 --> 24:52.200
You're truly a godsend.

24:52.210 --> 24:54.950
Someone who's just been chilled
can't be put in hot water right away.

24:54.960 --> 24:56.890
You have to warm
her up slowly with warm water,

24:56.920 --> 24:58.340
and then gradually add hotter water.

24:58.559 --> 24:59.279
All right.

26:08.559 --> 26:09.279
Slowly.

26:09.599 --> 26:10.480
Take small sips.

26:26.079 --> 26:27.319
Thank you.

26:28.839 --> 26:30.319
You've finally got some color back.

26:30.640 --> 26:31.839
When you first came in,

26:32.079 --> 26:33.759
you looked so pale. It was frightening.

26:34.720 --> 26:36.400
I should be thanking you.

26:38.720 --> 26:39.880
If it weren't for you,

26:40.400 --> 26:43.240
I'd have been the one
who went out with Young Madam today.

26:43.920 --> 26:45.960
You're so cautious,

26:45.960 --> 26:47.224
yet even you ended up like this.

26:47.440 --> 26:49.359
With how scatterbrained I am,

26:49.799 --> 26:51.960
I might've even lost my life.

26:54.400 --> 26:55.759
I wasn't careful enough.

26:56.839 --> 26:58.559
I acted too rashly.

27:00.720 --> 27:01.480
Yingge.

27:01.920 --> 27:02.920
Do you believe that?

27:03.160 --> 27:05.400
I don't believe a word of it.

27:06.000 --> 27:07.400
You really didn't remember.

27:07.816 --> 27:09.352
Don't listen to what you shouldn't hear.

27:09.559 --> 27:11.160
Don't say what you shouldn't say.

27:11.720 --> 27:13.039
If Lanxiang says it was her fault,

27:14.000 --> 27:15.279
then it was her fault.

27:18.519 --> 27:20.240
How could our masters ever be wrong?

27:52.000 --> 27:53.319
My mother always says

27:53.896 --> 27:55.920
a close neighbor
is better than a distant relative.

27:58.400 --> 28:00.440
Today, I finally
understand what she means.

28:03.400 --> 28:04.799
Thank you for taking care of me.

28:05.400 --> 28:07.200
I'm already acting like a young lady.

28:15.976 --> 28:17.590
The water for my feet has gone cold.

28:17.759 --> 28:18.400
Go

28:18.759 --> 28:20.000
and add some hot water for me.

28:21.759 --> 28:23.200
You little rascal.

28:23.400 --> 28:24.960
Give you an inch and you take a mile.

28:25.240 --> 28:26.160
If that's how it is,

28:26.200 --> 28:28.440
then tomorrow night,
you can bring me my footbath.

28:30.839 --> 28:31.720
Me too.

28:32.759 --> 28:33.559
Me too.

28:35.920 --> 28:36.680
All right.

28:36.920 --> 28:38.480
Tomorrow, I'll wait on both of you.

29:47.039 --> 29:48.440
Who am I?

29:50.920 --> 29:51.720
Mom.

29:52.559 --> 29:54.440
Why did you come back all of a sudden?

29:54.440 --> 29:56.664
Madam Feng gave me permission
to come home for a visit.

29:58.056 --> 29:59.310
Let me have a good look at you.

29:59.599 --> 30:00.839
Let me see how you've been.

30:04.079 --> 30:05.240
Your hands are freezing.

30:07.319 --> 30:09.079
I'm a second-class maid now.

30:09.759 --> 30:11.319
I don't have to do much hard labor,

30:11.920 --> 30:13.400
and I get enough to eat every day.

30:13.559 --> 30:15.680
Zijin even shares with us

30:15.720 --> 30:17.400
the pastries
Young Madam doesn't finish.

30:18.160 --> 30:20.480
I'm wearing the new
padded jacket you made for me,

30:20.519 --> 30:21.559
so I haven't been cold.

30:22.160 --> 30:22.839
Good.

30:24.319 --> 30:25.160
It's cold outside.

30:25.440 --> 30:26.240
Come inside.

30:27.784 --> 30:28.728
Get some rest first.

30:28.744 --> 30:30.390
I'll make you some steamed egg custard.

30:30.400 --> 30:31.000
Mom.

30:32.200 --> 30:33.720
I have to hurry back.

30:35.440 --> 30:37.519
You just got home.
Why are you leaving already?

30:40.759 --> 30:42.519
Did something happen?

30:43.920 --> 30:46.960
Yesterday, I went out
with Young Madam

30:47.079 --> 30:49.200
to her fabric shop.

30:49.519 --> 30:51.759
I accidentally spilled something

30:52.240 --> 30:54.079
and ruined a customer's fabric.

30:54.759 --> 30:56.480
But Young Madam was generous

30:56.519 --> 30:57.440
and didn't punish me.

30:58.039 --> 31:00.720
She only asked me to repay
what the shop paid the customer.

31:01.079 --> 31:03.799
The wages I've saved aren't enough,

31:04.160 --> 31:05.720
so I came home to see you.

31:07.240 --> 31:08.359
Don't worry.

31:18.759 --> 31:19.759
Listen to me.

31:20.039 --> 31:21.839
Whatever happens, don't be afraid.

31:23.519 --> 31:26.240
The money your father
and I saved is yours, too.

31:28.839 --> 31:30.920
If anything happens, just tell us.

31:31.680 --> 31:32.440
How much

31:32.759 --> 31:33.720
do you need?

31:35.559 --> 31:36.160
Take it.

31:51.480 --> 31:52.160
That's enough.

31:54.400 --> 31:55.240
Take a little more.

31:55.960 --> 31:56.960
Here, take it.

31:57.000 --> 31:58.960
If I get into trouble again,

31:59.000 --> 32:00.519
I can come home for money

32:00.559 --> 32:01.960
and see you again.

32:03.759 --> 32:05.279
If I don't need money,

32:06.000 --> 32:07.519
I won't have a chance to come home.

32:09.519 --> 32:10.319
Don't talk nonsense.

32:10.440 --> 32:11.960
There won't be a next time.

32:13.519 --> 32:14.599
May the wind carry those

32:15.200 --> 32:16.079
careless words away.

32:18.759 --> 32:19.519
Mom.

32:19.720 --> 32:21.839
Have you and Dad been well lately?

32:21.839 --> 32:22.519
Yes.

32:22.759 --> 32:23.960
We're both doing well.

32:24.160 --> 32:24.759
Very well.

32:24.759 --> 32:25.720
Don't worry.

32:26.799 --> 32:28.039
If anything comes up,

32:28.039 --> 32:29.400
go to Xiaolian's mother.

32:29.400 --> 32:30.240
Tell her

32:30.279 --> 32:31.720
to pass a message to me.

32:32.039 --> 32:32.799
Remember?

32:40.160 --> 32:41.559
Keep the money safe.

32:48.319 --> 32:50.039
Now go back.

32:50.400 --> 32:51.720
The road isn't easy to travel.

32:52.079 --> 32:53.279
Your duties come first.

32:53.599 --> 32:55.160
Don't upset your master.

32:58.940 --> 33:01.500
♪The wind blows past distant hills♪

33:02.559 --> 33:03.000
Go.

33:06.820 --> 33:10.500
♪Whose oil lamp burns tonight?♪

33:11.839 --> 33:12.279
Go.

33:17.720 --> 33:19.079
Look at me, forgetting again.

33:19.100 --> 33:22.300
♪Ripples stir across my brow♪

33:22.839 --> 33:23.920
I embroidered this for you.

33:24.599 --> 33:25.519
It's pretty, isn't it?

33:25.519 --> 33:26.240
It is.

33:26.720 --> 33:28.720
I kept wanting
to choose an auspicious day

33:28.759 --> 33:29.960
to give this to you.

33:30.240 --> 33:31.400
Since you came home today,

33:31.510 --> 33:33.336
today is
an auspicious day for our family.

33:33.880 --> 33:34.519
Take it.

33:34.960 --> 33:36.119
Replace the old one.

33:37.192 --> 33:38.590
The Chinese New Year is almost here.

33:38.600 --> 33:40.270
I'll change it on
Chinese New Year's Day.

33:40.296 --> 33:42.312
I'll wear
the new sachet in the new year.

34:00.599 --> 34:01.240
Mom.

34:01.304 --> 34:03.224
Young Madam
has sent someone to fetch me.

34:03.240 --> 34:04.240
I have to go.

34:05.759 --> 34:06.519
Go on.

34:53.760 --> 34:54.519
Young Master.

34:54.920 --> 34:55.800
I've brought her.

34:58.719 --> 34:59.400
Young Master.

35:01.679 --> 35:02.599
Come take a look.

35:13.559 --> 35:16.039
This is the Cold Mountain Painting
my father acquired.

35:18.616 --> 35:20.968
Ever since Grandfather
received the Cold Mountain Painting,

35:21.079 --> 35:22.519
he's been unable to put it down

35:23.079 --> 35:24.440
and has copied it over and over.

35:25.199 --> 35:27.840
This is his best copy.

35:31.280 --> 35:33.280
I thought it was the real one.

35:44.280 --> 35:47.360
I heard you taught your father to read.

35:52.719 --> 35:54.360
I was often ill as a child

35:54.472 --> 35:56.710
and used to recite sutras
with the monks at the temple.

35:57.400 --> 35:58.630
That's how I learned to read.

36:01.000 --> 36:01.920
What is this?

36:09.540 --> 36:12.140
(Diamond Sutra)

36:13.519 --> 36:15.000
The Diamond Sutra.

36:18.679 --> 36:20.559
If Young Madam
finds out you can read,

36:21.559 --> 36:22.719
what will happen to you?

36:24.559 --> 36:25.480
And what will happen

36:26.559 --> 36:27.679
to your parents?

36:38.639 --> 36:40.039
I'll end up worse off than Ji'er.

36:41.199 --> 36:44.119
My parents will also
be sold off by Young Madam,

36:44.840 --> 36:46.280
just like Ji'er's parents.

36:49.920 --> 36:51.000
Be my ears

36:52.000 --> 36:52.800
and eyes.

36:53.800 --> 36:56.000
Everything you hear

36:56.010 --> 36:57.560
and see while you're with Zhao Xingtang,

36:57.599 --> 36:58.920
report it all to me.

37:00.360 --> 37:01.800
If you do this well,

37:03.119 --> 37:04.159
I guarantee

37:06.776 --> 37:08.150
your whole family will be safe.

37:24.060 --> 37:26.860
(Diamond Sutra)

37:26.860 --> 37:31.100
♪Spring slips
from the branches once more♪

37:33.280 --> 37:34.639
As servants of the Lin Residence,

37:34.920 --> 37:37.480
we should naturally serve
Young Master with all our hearts.

37:39.820 --> 37:43.500
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

37:45.159 --> 37:45.840
You may go.

37:47.900 --> 37:52.700
♪Though all the world may fade,
time rolls on as countless lives rush by♪

37:54.380 --> 37:58.500
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

38:01.740 --> 38:05.740
♪No page could hold
the longing words can never show♪

38:07.780 --> 38:11.380
♪Every joy and sorrow
in this fleeting life♪

38:11.900 --> 38:14.820
♪Fades into the past as new wounds rise♪

38:15.460 --> 38:21.180
♪While whispers of perfume
linger beneath the eaves♪

38:21.620 --> 38:26.060
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

38:26.060 --> 38:29.420
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

38:29.420 --> 38:32.980
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

38:32.980 --> 38:35.740
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

38:35.740 --> 38:39.900
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

38:39.900 --> 38:43.220
♪And silver moonlight
to guide me through the night♪

38:43.220 --> 38:46.980
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

38:46.980 --> 38:51.940
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪

