40:12.519 --> 40:13.280
Young Master.

40:14.039 --> 40:14.960
What if Young Madam

40:15.030 --> 40:16.504
doesn't take Lanxiang to the banquet?

40:17.519 --> 40:19.000
She is proud and haughty.

40:19.304 --> 40:21.030
For an occasion like a birthday banquet,

40:21.800 --> 40:24.000
she would never
allow herself to lose face.

40:25.280 --> 40:26.719
Once she learns I won't be attending,

40:27.360 --> 40:28.960
she'll not only take Lanxiang,

40:29.280 --> 40:30.880
but Xiaolian as well,

40:31.239 --> 40:32.679
to win First Madam An's favor

40:33.159 --> 40:34.519
and help her

40:35.039 --> 40:36.440
keep up appearances at the banquet.

40:40.360 --> 40:41.920
Young Madam is certainly calculating.

40:42.559 --> 40:45.119
But she can never
outmaneuver you, Young Master.

40:45.719 --> 40:46.400
Now

40:47.079 --> 40:47.800
the trap is ready,

40:48.136 --> 40:48.840
the bait is set,

40:49.280 --> 40:50.519
and we have our informant.

40:50.880 --> 40:52.880
All that's left is to catch our prey.

40:55.519 --> 40:56.519
What did you say?

40:58.599 --> 41:00.639
Say that again if you dare.

41:02.159 --> 41:02.880
Young Master said

41:03.048 --> 41:05.416
he has important official business
to attend to tomorrow

41:05.448 --> 41:06.990
and won't be able to attend the banquet.

41:07.160 --> 41:08.712
He asked me to inform Young Madam.

41:33.000 --> 41:34.840
If Young Madam
has no further instructions,

41:35.440 --> 41:36.360
I'll take my leave.

41:47.519 --> 41:48.559
All of you, get out!

41:56.984 --> 41:58.150
You should leave for now.

42:14.519 --> 42:15.840
You can't go in right now.

42:16.199 --> 42:18.000
Young Madam is furious.

42:22.760 --> 42:24.000
Nanke came over and said

42:24.248 --> 42:25.710
Young Master won't be able to attend

42:25.710 --> 42:27.448
First Madam An's
birthday banquet tomorrow.

42:27.679 --> 42:28.639
Young Madam was so angry

42:28.760 --> 42:30.239
that she threw a scalding teacup

42:30.239 --> 42:31.639
straight at Nanke.

42:33.920 --> 42:35.360
He's a fool, too.

42:35.639 --> 42:37.199
It was as if he couldn't feel the heat.

42:37.320 --> 42:39.000
He didn't react at all.

42:39.199 --> 42:41.480
He even bowed before leaving.

42:42.760 --> 42:44.599
That only made
Young Madam even angrier.

43:05.020 --> 43:07.700
=Against the Current=
